<title>USA: Golden Books Q1 shr loss $.41 vs loss $.50.</title>
<headline>Golden Books Q1 shr loss $.41 vs loss $.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					  Three months ended</p>
<p>				  March 29, 1997  March 30, 1996</p>
<p>Total revenues		$   65,816	$   67,976</p>
<p>Total costs and expenses	71,126	    74,006</p>
<p>Net loss			    (8,872)	  (10,700)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share	(0.41)	    (0.50)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net loss for the first quarter of 1997 includes one-time transition costs of $2.8 million. Without the charge, the net loss would have been $6.1 million.</p>
<p>Full company name is Golden Books Family Entertainment Inc.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
